,"state":"AZ"},{"bioguideId":"K000405","fullName":"Rep. Knott, Brad [R-NC-13]","isOriginalCosponsor":true,"party":"R","sponsorshipDate":"2025-03-11","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"NC"},{"bioguideId":"H001102","fullName":"Rep. Harris, Mark [R-NC-8]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"R","sponsorshipDate":"2025-03-18","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"NC"},{"bioguideId":"H001101","fullName":"Rep. Harrigan, Pat [R-NC-10]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"R","sponsorshipDate":"2025-03-25","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"NC"},{"bioguideId":"H001067","fullName":"Rep. Hudson, Richard [R-NC-9]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"R","sponsorshipDate":"2025-04-30","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"NC"}],"fetchedAt":"2026-10-02T16:03:29+00:00","id":"hr2065-119","introducedDate":"2025-03-11","latestAction":{"actionDate":"2025-03-11","text":"Referred to the House Committee on the Judiciary."},"laws":[],"number":"2065","originChamber":"House","policyArea":"Crime and Law Enforcement","sponsors":[{"bioguideId":"M001240","district":6,"fullName":"Rep. McDowell, Addison [R-NC-6]","party":"R","state":"NC"}],"summaries":[{"actionDate":"2025-03-11","actionDesc":"Introduced in House","text":"<p><strong>Unmasking Hamas Act of 2025</strong></p><p>This bill establishes a new offense and strengthens the penalty for certain existing offenses involving prohibited conduct while wearing a disguise.</p><p>Specifically, it establishes a new criminal civil rights violation for wearing a disguise while interfering with another person's exercise of a protected right or privilege. A violator is subject to criminal penalties—a fine, a prison term of up to 15 years, or both.</p><p>Additionally, the bill establishes an enhanced penalty—a mandatory two-year prison term—for a person who wears a disguise during an offense involving the willful and malicious destruction of a building or property.</p>","updateDate":"2026-10-01T16:21:23Z","versionCode":"00"}],"title":"Unmasking Hamas Act of 2025","type":"hr","updateDate":"2026-10-01T16:21:54Z","updateDateIncludingText":"2026-10-01T16:21:54Z"}
